=Read these emails "{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}" and provide a very short, concise summary containing only the most important information from each one of these. Keep the summary as brief as possible without losing essential details. However also include Sender Email ID and Sent Date. Also frame an affirmative reply with header as "Reply". Format the output as json object for example
{"json"{
    "Sender ID" : Sender Email,
    "Sender Name" : Sender Name,
    "Sent Date" : Date,
    "Summary" : Summary,
    "Reply" : Reply

}}
